Round 4 (2026-02-26)

What changed this round
- Files changed: `clang/aot/_.c`, `clang/aot/emit.c`, `clang/runtime/eval_main.c`.
- Added dynamic AOT deopt instrumentation with reason + site IDs.
- `aot_fallback_alo` now records `reason` and `site`:
  - old: `aot_fallback_alo(tm_loc, len, ls_loc)`
  - new: `aot_fallback_alo(tm_loc, len, ls_loc, reason, site)`
- Emitter now assigns one monotonic deopt site ID per emitted fallback call and passes a reason enum.
- Added runtime counters in `clang/aot/_.c`:
  - per-reason hit counts,
  - per-site hit counts,
  - per-site last reason,
  - overflow counter when site ID exceeds cap (`AOT_DEOPT_SITE_CAP=65536`).
- Added gated reporting (`HVM_AOT_DEOPT` env var):
  - when enabled, prints deopt totals/reasons/top sites to `stderr` at end of `runtime_eval_main`.

